>is it publicly documented how one goes about naming multiple fruit?

Just use the option "fruit:".  You're permitted to change this option in the
middle of the game, and after you do so all new fruits will have the new
name instead of the old one.  Fruits which are already in existence will not
change their names (unlike Rogue).

Also, if you find fruits on a bones level the fruits retain the name given by
the former player.
